 "title": "1.5SMC series: 1500 W surface-mount TRANSZORB transient voltage suppressors, SMC (DO-214AB)",
 "source": {
  "document": "Document Number: 88303",
  "revision": "Revision: 09-Mar-2026",
  "pages": 6
 },
 "summary": "A family of glass-passivated transient voltage suppressors in the SMC (DO-214AB) package, rated for 1500 W peak pulse power with a 10/1000 µs pulse. Unidirectional parts (A suffix) span stand-off voltages of 5.8 V to 459 V; bidirectional parts (CA suffix) span 5.8 V to 185 V and behave the same in both directions. Its uses are guarding ICs, MOSFETs and sensor signal lines against transients from inductive switching and lightning. 1.5SMC15CA-E3/57T is the bidirectional 15 V part (12.8 V stand-off), RoHS-compliant commercial grade, on a 7-inch reel of 850.",
