   "A bidirectional part takes the CA suffix in place of A (1.5SMC15A becomes 1.5SMC15CA); bidirectional parts stop at 1.5SMC220CA.",
   "The full order code adds a grade and a packing code: -E3 RoHS-compliant commercial grade; -M3 halogen-free, RoHS-compliant commercial grade; HE3_X RoHS-compliant and AEC-Q101 qualified; HM3_X halogen-free, RoHS-compliant and AEC-Q101 qualified, X a revision letter. Packing 57T is a 7-inch reel of 850, 9AT a 13-inch reel of 3500; for the automotive codes H is the 7-inch reel and I the 13-inch reel.",
